22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am also ready. Let us proceed to the investigation phase. I expect the financial data to provide the necessary boundaries for our final decision.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'm ready as well. Let's be mindful that the data is a tool for fairness, not just efficiency. I look forward to seeing what the history of our seating reveals.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
