26,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'm ready. Let's see if the data actually supports a logical layout, or if we're just pretending to be objective while chasing vague feelings. I'll be waiting to see the results.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
