28,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready too! I'll do my best to find out how we can all stay close and support each other. Let's make this the best office layout ever!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
